mibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Cómo ganar puntos</h2><ul class="mt-4 divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md"><li data-accion="WIN_CHALLENGE" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Ganar un reto</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+300</span></li><li data-accion="TOP20" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Entrar en el top 20 de un reto</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+100</span></li><li data-accion="VIDEOS_PUBLICADOS" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Publicar 3 vídeos</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+100</span></li><li data-accion="INVITE_FRIEND" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Invitar a alguien que verifica su correo</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+50</span></li><li data-accion="REGISTERED_WITH_REFERRAL" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Registrarte con la invitación de alguien</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+50</span></li><li data-accion="RACHA_7_DIAS" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Racha de 7 días seguidos</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+50</span></li><li data-accion="VIDEO_50_LIKES" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Recibir 50 likes en un vídeo</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+10</span></li></ul></section></div><section aria-labelledby="historial" class="mt-10"><h2 id="historial" class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Tu historial de puntos</h2><p class="mt-4 rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/40 p-6 text-sm text-text-dim">Todavía no tienes movimientos. Gana un reto o invita a alguien y aparecerán aquí.</p></section></div>"`;

exports[`/puntos > en el nivel máximo, con racha 1`] = `"<div class="df-rise mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 lg:px-8 lg:py-12"><section aria-labelledby="mi-nivel" style="--df-halo-color: var(--df-rank);" class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 p-6 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-md)] backdrop-blur-md lg:p-10"><span class="df-halo" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center gap-7 text-center sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:gap-9 sm:text-left"><div data-nivel="legend" class="df-sheen relative flex h-32 w-32 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 bg-void/40" style="border-color: var(--df-rank); box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px color-mix(in srgb, var(--df-rank) 10%, transparent), 0 0 34px -6px color-mix(in srgb, var(--df-rank) 45%, transparent);"><div class="df-float flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Nivel Legend" class="h-20 w-20" style="color: var(--df-rank);"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="var(--df-void)"><path d="M4.6 18.3l-1.5-9.6 5.2 3.5L12 4.7l3.7 7.5 5.2-3.5-1.5 9.6zm1.7-2h11.4l.6-3.9-3.2 2.1L12 8.9l-3.1 5.6-3.2-2.1z"></path></g></svg></div></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-2xs tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase" aria-hidden="true">Tus puntos</p><h1 id="mi-nivel" class="mt-1 text-[clamp(3rem,10vw,4.5rem)] leading-[0.95] tabular-nums text-text" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-variation-settings: &quot;wght&quot; 800, &quot;wdth&quot; 125;"><span class="sr-only">Tus puntos: </span>999.999</h1><p class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 sm:justify-start"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold" style="color: var(--df-rank); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--df-rank) 45%, transparent); background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--df-rank) 12%, transparent);"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Nivel Legend" class="h-4 w-4" style="color: var(--df-rank);"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="var(--df-void)"><path d="M4.6 18.3l-1.5-9.6 5.2 3.5L12 4.7l3.7 7.5 5.2-3.5-1.5 9.6zm1.7-2h11.4l.6-3.9-3.2 2.1L12 8.9l-3.1 5.6-3.2-2.1z"></path></g></svg>Legend</span><span data-racha="5" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line px-3 py-1 text-sm text-text-dim">Racha de 5 días</span></p><p data-progreso="maximo" class="mt-5 text-sm font-medium text-text">Nivel máximo. No hay nada por encima de Legend.</p></div></div></section><div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 p-4 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md"><div class="relative flex items-start gap-3"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-2xs tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Puntos totales</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-3xl leading-none font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">999.999</p></div></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 p-4 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md" style="--df-halo-color: var(--df-rank);"><span class="df-halo opacity-60" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="relative flex items-start gap-3"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-2xs tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Nivel actual</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-3xl leading-none font-semibold tabular-nums text-text" style="color: var(--df-rank);">Legend</p><p class="mt-2 text-2xs text-text-dim">Desde 10.000 puntos</p></div><span class="shrink-0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Nivel Legend" class="h-8 w-8" style="color: var(--df-rank);"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="var(--df-void)"><path d="M4.6 18.3l-1.5-9.6 5.2 3.5L12 4.7l3.7 7.5 5.2-3.5-1.5 9.6zm1.7-2h11.4l.6-3.9-3.2 2.1L12 8.9l-3.1 5.6-3.2-2.1z"></path></g></svg></span></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 p-4 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md"><div class="relative flex items-start gap-3"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-2xs tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Progreso al siguiente</p><p class="mt-1.5 text-3xl leading-none font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">—</p><p class="mt-2 text-2xs text-text-dim">Ya estás en el nivel más alto</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,7fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-10"><section aria-labelledby="escalera"><h2 id="escalera" class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Los cinco niveles</h2><ol class="mt-4 divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md"><li data-nivel="rookie" data-estado="conseguido" class="flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 p-4 border-l-transparent "><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-text-dim" aria-hidden="true"></span></span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block text-sm text-text">Rookie</span><span class="block text-2xs text-text-dim">Desde el primer día</span></span></li><li data-nivel="challenger" data-estado="conseguido" class="flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 p-4 border-l-transparent "><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Nivel Challenger" class="h-6 w-6" style="color: var(--df-nivel-challenger);"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="var(--df-void)"><path d="M10.2 16.6L6 12.4l1.7-1.7 2.5 2.5 6.1-6.1L18 8.8z"></path></g></svg></span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block text-sm text-text">Challenger</span><span class="block text-2xs text-text-dim">Desde 100 puntos</span></span></li><li data-nivel="pro" data-estado="conseguido" class="flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 p-4 border-l-transparent "><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Nivel Pro" class="h-6 w-6" style="color: var(--df-nivel-pro);"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="var(--df-void)"><path d="M12 3.5c3 3.2 1.3 5 3.1 7.4 1.6 2.1 1.3 5-.7 6.7a5.6 5.6 0 01-7.4-.3c-1.8-1.9-1.6-4.9.4-6.8C9.6 8.6 9 6.3 12 3.5zm.1 7.9c-1.4 1.3-2 2.6-1.3 3.9.5 1 1.7 1.4 2.7.9 1.2-.6 1.5-1.9.8-3.2-.4-.7-1.2-1.2-2.2-1.6z"></path></g></svg></span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block text-sm text-text">Pro</span><span class="block text-2xs text-text-dim">Desde 500 puntos</span></span></li><li data-nivel="elite" data-estado="conseguido" class="flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 p-4 border-l-transparent "><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Nivel Elite" class="h-6 w-6" style="color: var(--df-nivel-elite);"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="var(--df-void)"><path d="M7.2 4h9.6l3.2 5-8 11-8-11zm1.3 2l-1.6 2.5h2.9L11 6zm4.1 0l1.2 2.5h2.9L15.1 6zm-.4 12.1l5-7.6H7.8z"></path></g></svg></span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block text-sm text-text">Elite</span><span class="block text-2xs text-text-dim">Desde 2000 puntos</span></span></li><li data-nivel="legend" data-estado="actual" aria-current="step" class="flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 p-4 bg-raised " style="border-left-color: var(--df-rank);"><span class="flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" role="img" aria-label="Nivel Legend" class="h-6 w-6" style="color: var(--df-rank);"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="12" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="var(--df-void)"><path d="M4.6 18.3l-1.5-9.6 5.2 3.5L12 4.7l3.7 7.5 5.2-3.5-1.5 9.6zm1.7-2h11.4l.6-3.9-3.2 2.1L12 8.9l-3.1 5.6-3.2-2.1z"></path></g></svg></span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1"><span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-text">Legend</span><span class="block text-2xs text-text-dim">Desde 10.000 puntos</span></span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs border px-2 py-0.5 text-2xs tracking-wide uppercase" style="color: var(--df-rank); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--df-rank) 45%, transparent);">Estás aquí</span></li></ol></section><section aria-labelledby="como-ganar"><h2 id="como-ganar" class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Cómo ganar puntos</h2><ul class="mt-4 divide-y divide-line overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md"><li data-accion="WIN_CHALLENGE" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Ganar un reto</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+300</span></li><li data-accion="TOP20" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Entrar en el top 20 de un reto</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+100</span></li><li data-accion="VIDEOS_PUBLICADOS" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Publicar 3 vídeos</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+100</span></li><li data-accion="INVITE_FRIEND" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Invitar a alguien que verifica su correo</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+50</span></li><li data-accion="REGISTERED_WITH_REFERRAL" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Registrarte con la invitación de alguien</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+50</span></li><li data-accion="RACHA_7_DIAS" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Racha de 7 días seguidos</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+50</span></li><li data-accion="VIDEO_50_LIKES" data-estado="activa" class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised/60"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-text">Recibir 50 likes en un vídeo</span><span class="shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-raised px-2 py-1 text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text">+10</span></li></ul></section></div><section aria-labelledby="historial" class="mt-10"><h2 id="historial" class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Tu historial de puntos</h2><p class="mt-4 rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/40 p-6 text-sm text-text-dim">Todavía no tienes movimientos. Gana un reto o invita a alguien y aparecerán aquí.</p><nav aria-label="Paginación" class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><a rel="prev" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-1.5 rounded-sm border border-line px-4 text-sm font-medium text-text transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised lg:min-h-[38px]" href="/puntos"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Anterior</a><span></span></nav></section></div>"`;

exports[`/puntos > la pantalla de error 1`] = `"<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 lg:px-8 lg:py-12"><div class="rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface p-4 max-w-prose p-5 lg:p-6" role="alert"><h1 class="text-base font-semibold text-text">No hemos podido cargar tus puntos</h1><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-dim">Ha fallado algo de nuestro lado, no de lo que has hecho. Vuelve a intentarlo en un momento; si sigue igual, escríbenos.</p><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-transparent text-text border-line hover:bg-raised mt-4">Reintentar</button></div></div>"`;

exports[`/referidos > con gente cobrada y pendiente, y pendientes en el resumen 1`] = `"<div class="df-rise mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-4 py-8 lg:px-8 lg:py-12"><section aria-labelledby="invitar" style="--df-halo-color: var(--df-action);" class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 p-6 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-md)] backdrop-blur-md lg:p-10"><span class="df-halo" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="relative grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:items-start lg:gap-12"><div class="min-w-0"><h1 id="invitar" class="text-[clamp(1.75rem,5vw,2.75rem)] leading-[1.05] text-text" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-variation-settings: &quot;wght&quot; 800, &quot;wdth&quot; 110;">Invita y gana puntos</h1><p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-sm text-text-dim">Ganas <strong class="font-semibold text-text">50 puntos</strong> cuando tu invitado verifica su correo. Tu invitado gana otros tantos.</p><div class="mt-7 space-y-4"><div><label for="ref-enlace" class="block text-2xs tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Tu enlace</label><div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><input id="ref-enlace" readonly="" class="min-h-[44px] min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-sm border border-line bg-raised px-3 font-mono text-sm text-text" type="text" value="https://app.test/entrar?ref=ABC123"><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-action text-void border-transparent hover:brightness-110 shrink-0 shadow-[var(--df-cta-lift)]">Copiar</button></div></div><div><label for="ref-codigo" class="block text-2xs tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">Tu código</label><div class="mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><input id="ref-codigo" readonly="" class="min-h-[44px] min-